            "explanation": "官方答案为 C：中小学老师并未给她鼓励（中学老师多纠错让她失去热情），让她动念写书的是弟弟的夸赞——说她编的故事比书里的好得多，即来自弟弟的正面反馈。原文：\"But I still used to make up stuff to entertain my kid brother. He said my stories were way better than anything in books. That's what started me thinking maybe I could write one for publication one day.\""
