            "answer": 0,
            "explanation": "官方答案为 A：保罗说自行车运动吸引越来越多的人、他\"很想弄明白为什么会这样\"，解说或许能让他深入了解其中缘由，即他想理解这项运动的吸引力。原文：\"Something about it makes it increasingly attractive to more and more people around the world, not just in Europe, but also in Asia and South America, and I'm curious to know why that is. Commentating might give me an insight into that, I think.\""
