            "explanation": "官方答案 D：两人小时候都怕水、在周六游泳课上共同经历困难，正是这段「共患难」让他们成为挚友，对应 We became close because of a difficult shared experience。原文：\"We both struggled at first because we were so scared of the water, but that kind of brought us together and we've been best mates ever since.\""
