            "answer": 1,
            "explanation": "官方答案为 B：他说从播种到日后把长成的植物卖出、送进别人的花园「给了我极大的满足感」，即看到劳动成果很有回报，对应 He found seeing the results of his work there very rewarding；艰苦条件靠父母劝阻才坚持（A 反向）。原文：\"Planting seeds then, some time later, selling the fully grown plants, ready to go into someone's garden, gave me great satisfaction.\""
