            "explanation": "官方答案为 A：他最看重「来到一片杂草丛生的花园，离开时它已焕然一新」，即把不美的地方变漂亮，对应 turning an unattractive place into somewhere beautiful；与同事共事（B）和薪水（C）他都说还不够或只是顺带提到。原文：\"The real appeal for me is that we can arrive in a garden, which is completely overgrown, and we leave it looking spectacular.\""
